        "1001129179": {
          "markers": [],
          "text": "To accelerate experimentation, the team is focusing on the following key areas:",
          "__type": "RawText"
        },
        "1001129183": {
          "values": {},
          "mixins": [],
          "__type": "RuleSet",
          "animations": null
        },
        "1001129184": {
          "markers": [],
          "text": "\"We only have a window of 6-8 weeks leading up to a tax season peak to launch experiments, where we launch, get confidence in results, and roll it into the baseline. With everything from small tweaks to big swings, Plasmic helps us more than double what we can do within this short window. We were able to find significant conversion rate lift with Plasmic.\"",
          "__type": "RawText"
        },
